      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "# M1 — vanilla gradient (GRAD) export\n",
        "\n",
        "Separate method, separate folder. Exports `|d logit_pneumonia / d input|`\n",
        "at 224x224 from the same 21 epoch-25 checkpoints and the same 601\n",
        "box-bearing test images, so GRAD's seed spread can be measured against\n",
        "Grad-CAM's under an identical pipeline.\n",
        "\n",
        "Writes to `grad_npy_25/seed_{S}/` — `{patientId}.npy` plus `preds.csv` in\n",
        "the same schema as the Grad-CAM export, so one scorer reads either folder.\n",
        "Nothing above is touched.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Run `REHEARSAL = True` first.** Only flip to `False` once it prints\n",
        "HASHES MATCH. Delete `grad_npy_25_rehearsal_A/` and `_B/` afterwards."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "t7ouFU-f6dcj",
