        "AUPRC analysis: CONFIRMATORY\n",
        "\n",
        "`ARUN` carries GBP 0.17, so the gap list has 7 entries.\n",
        "\n",
        "Note on C2: only GCAM's score moves under substitution, so the only pairs\n",
        "that can invert are XRAI→GCAM and GCAM→GRAD, and those are mutually\n",
        "exclusive. At most one adjacent pair can flip, which makes H2's \"≥2 pairs\"\n",
        "criterion unreachable by construction. Rank displacement is reported\n",
        "alongside the literal flip count."
      ]
